OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMorning fog patches soon
OL,6,Fclearing to leave a fine day, with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunny spells. Perhaps some
OL,8,Fcloudier moments over the higher
OL,9,Fground later in the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Fpleasantly warm in the sunshine, with
OL,11,Fan easterly breeze developing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening, then dry
OL,14,Fovernight with lengthy clear spells.
OL,15,FBreezy over the hills and along the
OL,16,Fcoast. Not quite as chilly as recent
OL,17,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
